# Real, secret-bearing runtime config — never committed. appsettings.json holds
# live Sophos credentials and API keys once filled in; appsettings.Secrets.json
# is the optional overlay file loaded by Program.cs for the same purpose.
# appsettings.json.example and appsettings.secrets.json.example are the
# committed templates (see README.md).
appsettings.json
appsettings.json.bak
appsettings.Secrets.json
!appsettings.json.example
!appsettings.secrets.json.example

